Subject: CPMS I03C Semantic Residual Registry

Description: Canonical formation for the pure inspectable registry that resolves every public procedure semantic residual to stable identity, covered roots, subject types, exact current code bindings, enforcement state, evaluation policy, and proof obligations. Formation grants no implementation or reader authority.

