& [Purpose] is exact residual resolution without authority execution
  + replace free residual strings with one stable catalogue
  + show where each condition is enforced observed incomplete or outside I03
  + bind every claim to source snapshots and proof obligations
  + permit deterministic pure lookup for later conformance reporting

& [ResidualPrinciple] is strict
  + JSON Schema proves only the constraints encoded by the schema document
  + each residual names a condition the schema cannot discharge
  + registry resolution does not satisfy the residual
  + satisfaction requires applicable bound enforcement and proof

& [Identity] is stable
  + baseline contains exactly RMS-R01 through RMS-R06 and I03-R007 through I03-R020
  + order is numeric by those two established families
  + identifiers cannot be renamed recycled or silently merged
  + split supersession and overlap are explicit typed relations

& [Record] contains id title class covered roots subject types applicability stages code bindings enforcement disposition evaluation policy severity proof references related residuals and rationale
  + every field is present
  + collections are sorted unique under their declared orders
  + free prose cannot replace a closed enum or binding

& [Roots] are prepare_input run_input verify_input base_response and preparation_response
  + root coverage states reachability of a subject or condition
  + applicability separately states when the condition governs
  + coverage cannot invoke an enforcement stage

& [Classes] are capacity semantic_structure integrity lineage authority replay result_shape and non_capability
& [Stages] are byte_ingress deserialize semantic_validation preparation authorship authorship_replay coordination_replay tool_schema tool_call controller_verification controller_replay admission and bounded_execution
& [Dispositions] are enforced partially_enforced unimplemented observational and outside_i03
& [Policies] are safe_pure observational_only and prohibited_authority
& [Severities] are informational release_blocking and authority_blocking

& [CodeSnapshot] binds repository-relative path baseline commit exact byte length and SHA256
& [InternalCodeBinding] binds crate module ordered function set and one CodeSnapshot
& [ExternalCodeBinding] binds locked package identity observed concept and external-observation status
  + source digest and symbol identity are authority
  + path and current line are advisory locators
  + changed source bytes invalidate dependent bindings until registry recompilation

& [RMS_R01] typed serde recursive capacity
  + roots all; subjects recursive public roots and serde_json Deserializer; stage deserialize
  + external binding serde_json locked dependency remaining-depth behavior
  + partially_enforced observational_only release_blocking
  + open proof is exact bounded byte-to-typed-reader capacity under the selected dependency

